rom Amazon just to check the hype"},{"startSeconds":4.102,"endSeconds":8.622,"text":"but there will be so much difference that I didn't expect."},{"startSeconds":8.622,"endSeconds":12.702,"text":"You know, some acne marks on my skin, some pores are visible,"},{"startSeconds":12.702,"endSeconds":15.702,"text":"meaning overall skin was a little dull."},{"startSeconds":15.702,"endSeconds":19.782,"text":"And then I tried this 10% Niacinamide serum."},{"startSeconds":19.782,"endSeconds":23.222,"text":"There is 10% Niacinamide which helps to make the skin brighter."},{"startSeconds":23.222,"endSeconds":27.782,"text":"There is also quajic acid which targets dark spots and tan also fades."},{"startSeconds":27.782,"endSeconds":30.702,"text":"Korean rice water gives skin a healthy glass light glow."},{"startSeconds":30.702,"endSeconds":34.142,"text":"Honestly, the most important thing is the texture."},{"startSeconds":34.142,"endSeconds":36.342,"text":"It's light weight and not sticky."},{"startSeconds":36.342,"endSeconds":39.822,"text":"Look, my skin was before and after consistently using it,"},{"startSeconds":39.822,"endSeconds":42.062,"text":"it's more bright and smooth."},{"startSeconds":42.062,"endSeconds":47.022,"text":"This brand has 3 days, acne marks, dark spots, visibly fade."},{"startSeconds":47.022,"endSeconds":50.342,"text":"And only 5 days, glow boosts."},{"startSeconds":50.342,"endSeconds":54.782,"text":"And only 14 days, pores help to minimize."},{"startSeconds":54.782,"endSeconds":57.702,"text":"You know, it has rice exosomes technology"},{"startSeconds":57.702,"endSeconds":60.542,"text":"which helps to reduce the pores appearance."},{"startSeconds":60.542,"endSeconds":63.142,"text":"Plus, it is also tested for sensitive skin."},{"startSeconds":63.142,"endSeconds":68.262,"text":"If you find a serum that is glow, acne marks, pore care,"},{"startSeconds":68.262,"endSeconds":71.142,"text":"then this one is worth it."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_919057ef58e6ddd251d3e