cne, I treat the person going through it. The one who’s tired of filters, of covering up, of feeling like their skin is working against them.\n\nWhen you step into my space, it’s more than a facial.\n\nIt’s a personalized transformation.\nIt’s science and soul.\nIt’s strategy and energy.\nIt’s care that actually goes somewhere.\n\nIf you’ve been waiting for a sign to try something different.. this is it!!!! Let me show you what’s possible when skincare finally aligns with you.\n\nSchedule a consultation by visiting my website! I can treat you in person or virtually 🫶🏼✨ You can also comment “book” below 👇🏼 and I will send you a direct link 🔗 \n\n💫 To my fellow aestheticians: if you’re dreaming of achieving these kinds of results for your clients, I’m here to guide you. Let’s refine your skills, boost your confidence, and transform your career. \n\nBook a 1:1 coaching session with me or subscribe to my exclusive Instagram content for insider tips and strategies. Together, let’s create skin miracles. 💕\n\n📍 Enlightened Beauty\nSacramento CA\n916 365 7958\nEnlightenedBeautySacramento.com\n\n#AcneSpecialist #EnlightenedBeauty #HolisticSkincare","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_52e195207667096b5962c1ec6ff9","publishedAt":"2026-09-17T18:09:50.000Z","profileId":"prf_352cde47d45ee71ce59388108823","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DdZeGRrANPT/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":4947420,"likesCount":424775,"sharesCount":29223,"commentsCount":5065,"interactionsCount":459063,"engagementRatePerViews":9.27883624192003,"engagementRatePerFollowers":504.5979159338727,"profileFollowersCount":154796,"profileFollowingCount":814,"profilePostsCount":2131,"mediaCount":1,"duration":40.145,"hashtags":["#acnespecialist","#enlightenedbeauty","#holisticskincare"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[],"platformId":"DdZeGRrANPT","profilePlatformId":"601805410","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/enlightened